<title>USA: Pamrapo buys back stock from shareholder.</title>
<headline>Pamrapo buys back stock from shareholder.</headline>
<dateline>BAYONNE, N.J. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pamrapo Bancorp Inc said it has purchased 278,900 shares from its largest shareholder Roger Conlan for $23.50 per share.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase of Conlan's shares was made under a special authorization by Pamrapo's board of directors. About 40,000 shares remain available under its current repurchase program.</p>
<p>Pamrapo was trading at 23-1/2 on Friday afternoon.</p>
